{"id":"f87aa675097602ab","group":"56","path":"56/56-ex-orthogonal-join-nonconfluence.md","title":"正交join条件系统仍可不局部合流","display":"ex-orthogonal-join-nonconfluence — 正交join条件系统仍可不局部合流","type":"example","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"example","label":"56-ex-orthogonal-join-nonconfluence","aliases":["56-ex-orthogonal-join-nonconfluence"],"display":"ex-orthogonal-join-nonconfluence — 正交join条件系统仍可不局部合流","depends_on":["[[56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite]]","[[56-df-orthogonal]]","[[56-df-normal-form]]","[[56-df-joinable]]","[[56-df-locally-confluent]]","[[56-df-confluent]]"],"source_section":"§4.11 Example 4.11.5; Figure 4.34; Remark 4.11.6","source_printed_pages":"143–144","source_statement_status":"source-example-compared; explicit-layer-witnesses-reviewed","source_proof_status":"local-proof-reviewed; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"label","html":"56-ex-orthogonal-join-nonconfluence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-ex-orthogonal-join-nonconfluence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-orthogonal-join-nonconfluence — 正交join条件系统仍可不局部合流"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b1c8fb0e112e49fa\" href=\"?note=b1c8fb0e112e49fa\" title=\"56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite\">56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"34fb9d07dfbad48c\" href=\"?note=34fb9d07dfbad48c\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal\">56-df-orthogonal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e295b2b3159f2b40\" href=\"?note=e295b2b3159f2b40\" title=\"56-df-normal-form\">56-df-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1de67f45113d6dcf\" href=\"?note=1de67f45113d6dcf\" title=\"56-df-joinable\">56-df-joinable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"766a1d5bf25248d1\" href=\"?note=766a1d5bf25248d1\" title=\"56-df-locally-confluent\">56-df-locally-confluent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c74959a8cb14eaa5\" href=\"?note=c74959a8cb14eaa5\" title=\"56-df-confluent\">56-df-confluent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.11 Example 4.11.5; Figure 4.34; Remark 4.11.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"143–144"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-example-compared; explicit-layer-witnesses-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-proof-reviewed; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C,\\mathsf B,\\mathsf E\">\\(\\mathsf C,\\mathsf B,\\mathsf E\\)</span> 为互异函数符号，元数分别为1、0、0；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 为与这些符号不交的可数无限变量集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle(a,b)\\rangle\">\\(\\langle(a,b)\\rangle\\)</span> 表示长度1的条件列表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\rangle\\)</span> 为空列表。条件系统的删条件规则集、层关系和join语义采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b1c8fb0e112e49fa\" href=\"?note=b1c8fb0e112e49fa\" title=\"56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite\">56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NF}(T,J,t)\">\\(\\mathrm{NF}(T,J,t)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Join}(T,J,s,t)\">\\(\\mathrm{Join}(T,J,s,t)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocallyConfluent}(T,J)\">\\(\\mathrm{LocallyConfluent}(T,J)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Confluent}(T,J)\">\\(\\mathrm{Confluent}(T,J)\\)</span> 采用相应直接依赖的参数化接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\coloneqq(\\{\\mathsf C,\\mathsf B,\\mathsf E\\},\n\\{(\\mathsf C,1),(\\mathsf B,0),(\\mathsf E,0)\\}),\\qquad\nT\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma\\coloneqq(\\{\\mathsf C,\\mathsf B,\\mathsf E\\},\n\\{(\\mathsf C,1),(\\mathsf B,0),(\\mathsf E,0)\\}),\\qquad\nT\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\mathsf C(x),\\mathsf E,\\langle(x,\\mathsf C(x))\\rangle),\n(\\mathsf B,\\mathsf C(\\mathsf B),\\langle\\rangle)\\},\n\\qquad J\\coloneqq J_{\\mathcal C}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\mathsf C(x),\\mathsf E,\\langle(x,\\mathsf C(x))\\rangle),\n(\\mathsf B,\\mathsf C(\\mathsf B),\\langle\\rangle)\\},\n\\qquad J\\coloneqq J_{\\mathcal C}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm u}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm u}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\mathsf B,\\mathsf C(\\mathsf B))\\in Y_{\\mathcal C,1}^{1},\n\\qquad\n(\\mathsf C(\\mathsf B),\\mathsf E)\\in Y_{\\mathcal C,2}^{1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\mathsf B,\\mathsf C(\\mathsf B))\\in Y_{\\mathcal C,1}^{1},\n\\qquad\n(\\mathsf C(\\mathsf B),\\mathsf E)\\in Y_{\\mathcal C,2}^{1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\mathsf C(\\mathsf C(\\mathsf B)),\\mathsf E)\\in Y_{\\mathcal C,2}^{1}\n\\land\n(\\mathsf C(\\mathsf C(\\mathsf B)),\\mathsf C(\\mathsf E))\\in Y_{\\mathcal C,2}^{1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\mathsf C(\\mathsf C(\\mathsf B)),\\mathsf E)\\in Y_{\\mathcal C,2}^{1}\n\\land\n(\\mathsf C(\\mathsf C(\\mathsf B)),\\mathsf C(\\mathsf E))\\in Y_{\\mathcal C,2}^{1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NF}(T,J,\\mathsf E)\\land\n\\mathrm{NF}(T,J,\\mathsf C(\\mathsf E))\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{Join}(T,J,\\mathsf E,\\mathsf C(\\mathsf E)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NF}(T,J,\\mathsf E)\\land\n\\mathrm{NF}(T,J,\\mathsf C(\\mathsf E))\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{Join}(T,J,\\mathsf E,\\mathsf C(\\mathsf E)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{LocallyConfluent}(T,J)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Confluent}(T,J).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\mathrm{LocallyConfluent}(T,J)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Confluent}(T,J).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书Example 4.11.5、Figure 4.34与Remark 4.11.6（印刷第143–144页）已实际读取。删去条件后两个左部左线性，非变量位置没有非平凡重叠，所以正交。第1层有B→C(B)，因而条件B与C(B)在第1层可汇合，产生第2层C(B)→E。第1层也有C(B)→C(C(B))，所以根部C(C(B))→E同样在第2层成立；在其内部收缩C(B)得到另一个第2层结果C(E)。</p>\n<p>E没有任何候选红项。对层数归纳，C(E)也没有归约：若第n层无该步，则E和C(E)都在该层为不同正规形，不能可汇合，故第n+1层不能生成C(E)→E；其内部E亦不可改写。取所有层的并，两个分支仍为不同正规形，所以不可汇合。这个归纳排除了凭最终关系循环为条件提供自我证据。</p>\n<p>原书随后强调，把半等式条件改成join条件会改变最小关系的构造，不能因为一个已知合流关系中转换与可汇合等价，就认为两种条件系统自动相同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"b1c8fb0e112e49fa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-orthogonal","status":"resolved","id":"34fb9d07dfbad48c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-orthogonal]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"e295b2b3159f2b40","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-joinable","status":"resolved","id":"1de67f45113d6dcf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-joinable]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-locally-confluent","status":"resolved","id":"766a1d5bf25248d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-locally-confluent]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-confluent","status":"resolved","id":"c74959a8cb14eaa5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-confluent]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"b1c8fb0e112e49fa","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf C,\\mathsf B,\\mathsf E$ 为互异函数符号，元数分别为1、0、0；$V$ 为与这些符号不交的可数无限变量集，$x\\in V$。$\\langle(a,b)\\rangle$ 表示长度1的条件列表，$\\langle\\rangle$ 为空列表。条件系统的删条件规则集、层关系和join语义采用 [[56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite]]；$\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)$、$\\mathrm{NF}(T,J,t)$、$\\mathrm{Join}(T,J,s,t)$、$\\mathrm{LocallyConfluent}(T,J)$ 和 $\\mathrm{Confluent}(T,J)$ 采用相应直接依赖的参数化接口。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\maths